silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_flat_sections_06_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The 06_kg_cross_referenceSourceNode is The typed source federation object for 06_kg_cross_reference. In the Mittens example: VetRecord_Mittens, StoragePacket_Mittens, or KGAssertion_Mittens depending on the operation path. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Source (typed federation object)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
