silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_flat_sections_06_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor_node2 silm:hasLongDescription "The 06_kg_cross_referenceOperationNode is The operation or gate node for 06_kg_cross_reference. KGNode_Mittens is a source leg. lambda_graph: KGAssertion_Mittens -> Mittens. KG label is not Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Operation or gate', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
